{"parse": {"title": "LD-17", "pageid": 84471, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LD-16\" title=\"LD-16\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LD-17</span><a href=\"/wiki/LD-18\" title=\"LD-18\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">17</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.BC.80.E5.B9.95.E5.BC.8F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"开幕式\">开幕式</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 开幕式</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Opening Ceremony</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>朋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>友<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>看<span class=\"color-value\"></span>起<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>光<span class=\"color-value\"></span>彩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>夺<span class=\"color-value\"></span>目<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2310117</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang7_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_yundonghuichang7_zone\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_yundonghuichang7_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang7_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang7_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"329\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang7_zone.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang7_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang7_zone.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang7_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1708\" data-file-height=\"936\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>威廉叔叔，康蒂婶婶，小玛丽，老汉斯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十字街的居民们齐齐地站在台前，他们还手执锤头和木锯，老汉斯悄悄地将铁锹踢到了身后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金丝绵雀在树上神经质地频繁扭着头，好奇地盯着这群于阴沉的冬日中聚集起来的人们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>由我来吧，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牙仙微微颔首，宽檐帽便走上了木头临时搭建起来的主席台上。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>测试，测试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>女士们，先生们，今天是乌卢鲁运动会预选赛举办的日子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>但同时，令人郁闷的，也是个有雾的日子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>台下的人们看着宽檐帽，脸上还留着水泥与煤灰的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>没有风，没有阳光，天阴冷得吓人，我的帽檐上也潮潮的，总之是令人不舒坦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>没有辉煌雄伟的赛场，参赛的运动员人数也令人难以启齿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>这是一届令人失望的、不被人看好的乌卢鲁运动会预选赛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>但是，各位！即便失去了基金会的资金支持，我们仍旧靠我们的双手和对运动的热情，在几天之内，搭建起了一个标准规格的赛场！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>身为一个合格的政府官员的助手，我能肯定地说，我们搭建的赛场是符合各类法条的检验标准的，它足以得到基金会的认可！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>并且，通过各类业内人士与民间爱好者的帮助，我们还组建起了一个足够专业的工作团队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>他们正在赛场的各处，为预选赛的正常举办做着各类准备工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>这些人将成为本届乌卢鲁运动会预选赛的脊梁，撑起整场比赛，保证预选赛能够顺利进行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>所以，我认为，它是一届充满热情的、永不服输的乌卢鲁运动会预选赛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>现在，我宣布——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>乌卢鲁运动会伦敦预选赛，正式——开始！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们如热锅上的滚水珠般，喧闹且忙碌着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纷至沓来的问题围绕着牙仙、宽檐帽和纸信圈儿三人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-627520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-627520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-627520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">裁判组成员Ⅰ：</div><div>牙仙小姐！叩门飞匙赛的裁判不够了！弗朗茨的时间跟别的项目撞上了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>不够了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>他是明天那个项目的裁判，他记错时间了，叫他回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">广播声：</div><div>请参加1500米负重竞速的选手到第三准备区集合，请参加1500米负重竞速的选手到第三准备区集合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">参赛选手Ⅰ：</div><div>您好，我的号码牌丢了，能再给我一张吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>带着你的证件，直走左转，去证件补办处找一名叫“纸信圈儿”的小女孩补办。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">裁判组成员Ⅱ：</div><div>来吧，好兄弟，我带你去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">参赛选手Ⅰ：</div><div>好，好，谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>哦哦哦！等一下，“好兄弟”，我怎么从来没有见过你？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宽檐帽有些疑惑地盯着这名裁判组的成员，一把扯过他掖在大衣内的裁判证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>这个证件是伪造的，安保人员！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">裁判组成员Ⅱ：</div><div>我只是一名爱好者罢了，一切好说行吗？放开我！我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>负责安保的志愿者们闻声赶来，将伪装成裁判的狂热爱好者带了出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>其中一人趁机与宽檐帽耳语了几句。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>牙仙女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>怎么了，安保队长？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>有人告诉我，一位绅士伙计想要在会场内张贴广告语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>我们之前已经与别人达成了合约，恐怕你得拒绝他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>是福葛伙计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>顺着宽檐帽转去的方向，牙仙在会场的入口看到了一条白底黑字的横幅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“吸雾有害健康。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-305310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-305310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-305310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>他一直和他那个坏掉的机器坐在横幅下吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-310601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"21\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-310601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-310601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"125\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>是的，福葛伙计从运动会开始时便守在那里，借由那台破铁块，向每一位前来参加运动会的人展示吸入过多雾气的后果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-305311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-305311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-305311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>是该说他立场不坚定，还是该说他过于固执？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-310601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"21\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-310601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-310601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"125\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>福葛伙计一直都是一位真心为选民服务的政府官员，正直地、坚韧地、强硬地影响着他身边的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-305312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-305312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-305312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>你是位天生的发言人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牙仙转向在会场中备赛的运动员和为运动员呐喊助威的观众们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众Ⅰ：</div><div>加油！加油！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众Ⅱ：</div><div>第一名！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众Ⅲ：</div><div>呜——呜——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">参赛选手Ⅱ：</div><div>谢谢！谢谢～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正准备起跑的运动员向观众们做出了飞吻的回应，又获得了一阵欢呼声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>这些雾是阻挡不了人们对运动的热情的，不论如何，人们都要将乌卢鲁运动会举办下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>他还不愿接受纸信圈儿的小被单吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>按照福葛伙计的意思，身为雾行者是不可向浓雾低头的，他不会逃避，而是会“迎战”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>笨拙的福葛伙计……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">广播声：</div><div>请参加自由祭祀的选手到第五准备区集合，请参加自由祭祀的选手到第五准备区集合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>哦！是笃笃骨女士的项目……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>她会上场吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_zhunbeishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_zhunbeishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>牙仙女士，宽檐帽先生，你们听到了吗？自由祭祀要开始了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>笃笃骨在哪里呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牙仙与宽檐帽对视了一眼，牙仙看不到宽檐帽的眼神，但她从帽檐的微动作中感受到了一些迷茫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>二人似乎都不知该对这个孩子说些什么，不知该点燃她的希望，还是戳破她的幻想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亦或是正中她的下怀？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>你去自由祭祀的会场那边看看吧，纸信圈儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>去干嘛呢？难道笃笃骨会在那里吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子似乎猜中了牙仙的言外之意，她直直地盯着牙仙的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>难道笃笃骨会在那里吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>不去看看的话，怎么会知道呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牙仙微微笑着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>“证件补办处”这里由我值守更好些，你去吧，纸信圈儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>去吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子的脸上先是冒出了笑容，却又现出了一些迟疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>这次……我不会再带给笃笃骨坏消息了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>我真的为她带来了一场盛会，它不是我梦里咬一口却没有味道的烤鸡，它真实得不能更真实了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像是下定决心一般，孩子向牙仙和宽檐帽挥了挥手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>那边见！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>言罢，纸信圈儿便跑走了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_zhunbeishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_zhunbeishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第五准备区，候场的自由祭祀运动员们在各自做着热身运动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-629001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-629001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-629001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">2401号选手：</div><div>看看这个场地，随便哪所女子学校的操场也比这个好，这届乌卢鲁运动会预选赛真是有趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>这是在几天的时间内搭好的，我们也不能要求太多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-629001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-629001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-629001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">2401号选手：</div><div>哦，天呐，卡洛琳女士，您好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>2401号赶紧擦擦手，然后向卡洛琳伸去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>练习的时候要小心了，不要磕到自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-629001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-629001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-629001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">2401号选手：</div><div>谢谢，您真温柔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一名戴着志愿者工作证的工作人员从门口走了进来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">志愿者Ⅰ：</div><div>请各位参加自由祭祀的选手确认上场顺序，比赛马上就要开始了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">志愿者Ⅰ：</div><div>2401号选手，请上场。2402、2403号选手，请在这里候场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">2402号选手：</div><div>祝你好运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几名候场的运动员向2401号选手送上祝福，2401号向众人挥手告别后，就走向了赛场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到了比赛开始的消息，卡洛琳停下了热身运动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>夏洛特呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310415.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-310415.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310415.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310415.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-310415.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310415.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-310415.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310415.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>呼——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-628616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-628616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-628616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"127\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>夏洛特，你果然在这里，这么多年，你的习惯一直没变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310415.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-310415.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310415.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310415.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-310415.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310415.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-310415.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310415.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_at_zhaocha.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_at_zhaocha\"><img alt=\"2_3_at_zhaocha\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/Cg-2_3_at_zhaocha.png/600px-Cg-2_3_at_zhaocha.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/Cg-2_3_at_zhaocha.png/900px-Cg-2_3_at_zhaocha.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/Cg-2_3_at_zhaocha.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_at_zhaocha.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笃笃骨停下了正在做的伸展运动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>你有什么事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-628616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-628616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-628616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"127\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>什么事？你忘记挑战那回事了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>你是几号？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>与你有什么关系……哦，我明白了，越是高贵的人做起志愿者来就越迷人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>我真不懂……你怎么能源源不断地吐出这么多刻薄的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>你还需要接着适应呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>是吗？你以后还会与我讲许多话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笃笃骨别过头去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>我不再是之前那个夏洛特了，别老是过来套近乎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡洛琳向夏洛特走了过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>但我觉得没有区别呀，夏洛特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>你一直就是我追寻的那只黑天鹅，是你在赛场的身影为我带来了成为自由祭祀运动员的梦想，可你成为冠军后便销声匿迹了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>不过……呵呵～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>有什么好笑的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡洛琳坦然地看着笃笃骨，脸上带着微微的笑意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>赛场见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>简短地告别后，卡洛琳便回到了候场区。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_zhunbeishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_zhunbeishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_zhunbeishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">志愿者Ⅰ：</div><div>2406号选手，卡洛琳，请上场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>志愿者的声音从房间内传出，人声因为墙壁的阻隔而显得失真。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笃笃骨跺了跺略微僵硬的右腿，发出了“笃笃”的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>我也该回去了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310415.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-310415.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310415.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310415.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-310415.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310415.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-310415.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310415.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>请让一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笃笃骨来到了观众席，坐在一个角落中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡洛琳踏着轻盈的脚步上了场，向裁判们示意后，她轻轻地抚摸了放于场前的“迪吉里木”，然后回到场中，摆出预备的姿势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">广播声：</div><div>2406号，卡洛琳，请开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡洛琳舞蹈了起来，与此同时，“迪吉里木”接收到了卡洛琳灌输而来的能量，也开始了它的奏鸣。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LD-17"}}